y:\r\n- start app\r\n- global search -> open file\r\n- ctrl-o to go to previous jump\r\n\r\nthe issue was that the empty scratch buffer created at app start was being added to the jump list when switching to a file using the global search. There was a similar check elsewhere that checked on doc delete but not on switch\r\n\r\nThe panic itself was coming from the `current!` macro trying to unwrap a non-existent document.\r\n\r\nWould it not make more sense to have the `current!` macro return an option tuple to avoid issues like this crashing the program?\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/helix-editor/helix/issues/comments/1140248331/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"Termina94","id":47091253,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDkxMjUz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47091253?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Termina94","html_url":"https://github.com/Termina94","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Termina94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Termina94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Termina94/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Termina94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Termina94/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Termina94/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Termina94/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Termina94/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Termina94/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/helix-editor/helix/issues/comments/1140252102","html_url":"https://github.com/helix-editor/helix/issues/1238#issuecomment-1140252102","issue_url":"http